on social media, order clothes online, and play mobile games without a care in the world. As time progressed, companies eventually realized that they could collect small pieces of information from a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":172827,"global_rank":436790},{"name":"rachfop/takomo-docs","owner":"rachfop","html_url":"https://github.com/rachfop/takomo-docs","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Takomo documentation","topics":[],"score":172827,"global_rank":436791},{"name":"aeonstasis/L-syntax-highlighting","owner":"aeonstasis","html_url":"https://github.com/aeonstasis/L-syntax-highlighting","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Syntax highlighting for the language L, the most popular pure functional programming language in CS 345H","topics":[],"score":172825,"global_rank":436792},{"name":"royhowie/csc431-pr-practice","owner":"royhowie","html_url":"https://github.com/royhowie/csc431-pr-practice","stars":0,"forks":3,"watchers":0,"issues":2,"language":"Other","description":"practice a pull request","topics":[],"score":172823,"global_rank":436800},{"name":"kzys/memcacheb","owner":"kzys","html_url":"https://github.com/kzys/memcacheb","stars":3,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Web based memcached browser","topics":[],"score":172818,"global_rank":436801},{"name":"rrarunan/alpine-mongoshell","owner":"rrarunan","html_url":"https://github.com/rrarunan/alpine-mongoshell","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","des